s/PMC5493194/</a>) example to illustrate our method? Would this be acceptable if the written report covers the challenge case, or must the video also present challenge-case findings? Out of abundance of caution, we want to avoid discussing patient genetics if we can avoid it.</p>\n<p>Thank you so much for the clarification,</p>\n<p>Fadi</p>\n","updatedAt":"2026-10-19T21:58:49.275Z","author":{"_id":"6798b1e0b26d8bb50f728481","avatarUrl":"/avatars/1b1bcaa32c0bcbd268a978cc14ed5658.svg","fullname":"Fadi Towfic","name":"ftowfic","type":"user","isPro":false,"isHf":false,"isHfAdmin":false,"isMod":false,"isUserFollowing":false}},"numEdits":0,"identifiedLanguage":{"language":"en","probability":0.8621987700462341},"editors":["ftowfic"],"editorAvatarUrls":["/avatars/1b1bcaa32c0bcbd268a978cc14ed5658.svg"],"reactions":[],"isReport":false}},{"id":"6ad69bf1f386860028105e9e","author":{"_id":"6a5000a46230d22db3702bcd","avatarUrl":"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/no-auth/ZCXPMhtkGu908ljVryFyw.png","fullname":"Gaia Andreoletti","name":"gandreoletti","type":"user","isPro":false,"isHf":false,"isHfAdmin":false,"isMod":false,"isUserFollowing":false,"isOwner":false,"isOrgMember":true},"createdAt":"2026-10-19T22:38:41.000Z","type":"comment","data":{"edited":false,"hidden":false,"latest":{"raw":"hi @ftowfic ,\n\nsure it is acceptable to use the  paper as example of your method.\nand also acceptable for the written report to cover the challenge case.\n\nThanks,\nGaia","html":"<p>hi <span class=\"SVELTE_PARTIAL_HYDRATER contents\" data-target=\"UserMention\" data-props=\"{&quot;user&quot;:&quot;ftowfic&quot;}\"><span class=\"inline-block\"><span class=\"contents\"><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/ftowfic\">@<span class=\"underline\">ftowfic</span></a></span> </span></span> ,</p>\n<p>sure it is acceptable to use the  paper as example of your method.<br>and also acceptable for the written report to cover the challenge case.</p>\n<p>Thanks,<br>Gaia</p>\n","updatedAt":"202